{"id":"oxy8shv6v1h266ocrxly7o9ia","title":"Go 编译器的汇编语言快速指南","originalTitle":"A Quick Guide to Go's Assembler","summary":"Go 编译器使用一种独特的汇编语言，基于 Plan 9 汇编器的输入风格，但不直接映射到底层机器指令。该语言在生成代码后进行部分指令选择，因此汇编指令可能不会直接对应机器指令，而是可能被转换为其他操作，如清除或加载。了解汇编代码时，需注意 Go 的汇编器生成的实际指令可能与汇编代码不同。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"Lobsters 热榜"},"links":{"original":"https://go.dev/doc/asm"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-05T22:07:32.833Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-05T22:10:27.728Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-05T22:10:27.728Z","category":"languages-runtime","tags":["教程与观点","GitHub"],"score":44,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"51f53655-5f52-456f-b1ce-eeeacbe6db50","title":"Go发布汇编语言指南并澄清生成机制差异"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"51f53655-5f52-456f-b1ce-eeeacbe6db50","title":"Go发布汇编语言指南并澄清生成机制差异"}],"topics":[{"slug":"github","name":"GitHub"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"foD8OJBD1ofc","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}